OL,3,GNEWSABody found during search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for missing Limerick
OL,7,Fwoman Carrie Mullane have recovered a
OL,8,Fbody from Lough Erne in County
OL,9,FFermanagh.
OL,11,FThey said they were in contact with her
OL,12,Ffamily to let them know about the
OL,13,Fdevelopment but added that formal
OL,14,Fidentification "may take a period of
OL,15,Ftime".
OL,17,FThe 39-year-old has been missing since
OL,18,Fshe arrived in Enniskillen from
OL,19,FLimerick on 10 October 2026.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
